DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
9850::$$$message_0074_0000_0000$$$::"Hey! What a coincidence, Shirou![lr]::
9851::$$$message_0074_0000_0001$$$::Are you done with school?"[lr]::
9852::$$$message_0074_0000_0002$$$::I don't know when she got here before me, but Illya was waiting at the school gate.[lr]::
9853::$$$message_0074_0000_0003$$$::I wondered why Illya was following me around, but I feel like it wouldn't be right to ask her about it when she's smiling like that.::
9854::$$$message_0074_0001_0000$$$::"Yeah. I was walking around seeing if there's any leads, but I was thinking of finishing up.[lr]::
9855::$$$message_0074_0001_0001$$$::Are you coming back from a walk?"::
9856::$$$message_0074_0002_0000$$$::"Yes. I was also observing for my amusement. There's usually a lot of people, so I aimed for a time when there's not many people.[lr]::
9857::$$$message_0074_0002_0001$$$::The results were...well, I wasn't bored."[lr]::
9858::$$$message_0074_0002_0002$$$::...I feel a bit of regret.[lr]::
9859::$$$message_0074_0002_0003$$$::Instead of walking around the hallway, I should've walked to the music room or the gymnasium or somewhere more fun.::
9860::$$$message_0074_0003_0000$$$::"I'm ashamed of myself. I guess neither of us achieved much."[lr]::
9861::$$$message_0074_0003_0001$$$::"Isn't that fine? I wasn't expecting anything tangible anyway. It was fun, all right."[lr]::
9862::$$$message_0074_0003_0002$$$::"I see. It was also fun... I think?"[lr]::
9863::$$$message_0074_0003_0003$$$::I wasn't bored at least.[lr]::
9864::$$$message_0074_0003_0004$$$::It was like I was being chased by something in the morning and afternoon[line len=3]wait, come to think of it...::
9865::$$$message_0074_0004_0000$$$::"Illya, have you come here incognito today? Like you came out here without telling the people at the castle?"[lr]::
9866::$$$message_0074_0004_0001$$$::"Yeah. They should get used to it, but they make a big fuss when I'm gone.[lr]::
9867::$$$message_0074_0004_0002$$$::I had prepared a lot of things to surprise you with, but everything went to waste because those two were around."::
9868::$$$message_0074_0005_0000$$$::"Oh... That's, um[line len=2]"[lr]::
9869::$$$message_0074_0005_0001$$$::Should I be thanking those two?[lr]::
9870::$$$message_0074_0005_0002$$$::Illya's new prank at school sounds a bit scary.::
9871::$$$message_0074_0006_0000$$$::"Mistress!"[lr]::
9872::$$$message_0074_0006_0001$$$::Well, speak of the devils, the maids are coming from the schoolyard. They exhibit an improper, but cute way of running while holding the hem of their skirts.::
9873::$$$message_0074_0007_0000$$$::"So you were here after all.[lr]::
9874::$$$message_0074_0007_0001$$$::...Please let us know when you go outside from now on."[lr]::
9875::$$$message_0074_0007_0002$$$::"I said I'm not going to do what I don't want to do. It means that I want to be by myself when I go out alone. You should take into account that much if you're a servant."::
9876::$$$message_0074_0008_0000$$$::"...I am aware, but this is an order from the Great Master.[lr]::
9877::$$$message_0074_0008_0001$$$::We are trying to protect you to the best of our ability, even if we have to use ourselves as a shield[line len=3]"[lr]::
9878::$$$message_0074_0008_0002$$$::"Ugh, I'm saying that's an eyesore![lr]::
9879::$$$message_0074_0008_0003$$$::You're a worrywart, Sella.[lr]::
9880::$$$message_0074_0008_0004$$$::There are only some dangerous things left in this town, and it's not like I can do anything about it."::
9881::$$$message_0074_0009_0000$$$::"...That is true, but... Danger does not only take a ferocious form.[lr]::
9882::$$$message_0074_0009_0001$$$::There is a saying called a snake in one's bosom.[lr]::
9883::$$$message_0074_0009_0002$$$::Even if they are usually an insignificant existence, it will become a big deal if they decide to betray you at a critical moment."[lr]::
9884::$$$message_0074_0009_0003$$$::Wait.[lr]::
9885::$$$message_0074_0009_0004$$$::Why are you saying that looking over here, blue maid?::
9886::$$$message_0074_0010_0000$$$::"...Mrgh. You have a point in your argument. I was prepared against outside enemies, but I wasn't even thinking of if I were attacked from my inner circle.[lr]::
9887::$$$message_0074_0010_0001$$$::But, that sounds kind of fun."[lr]::
9888::$$$message_0074_0010_0002$$$::Hold on.[lr]::
9889::$$$message_0074_0010_0003$$$::Why are you looking here while saying that, young lady?::
9890::$$$message_0074_0011_0000$$$::"...Enemy? Shirou, enemy?"[lr]::
9891::$$$message_0074_0011_0001$$$::"No. More like a human sacrifice. If anything, I'm in the category of a victim."[lr]::
9892::$$$message_0074_0011_0002$$$::"Humph, what a blatant lie. What are you saying, after summoning the Mistress to a place like this?[lr]::
9893::$$$message_0074_0011_0003$$$::Leysritt, Master Emiya is not an enemy, but he is not an ally either. Please punish him without mercy if he makes the Mistress sad from now on."::
9894::$$$message_0074_0012_0000$$$::...Mrgh, the situation is becoming dangerous by the second.[lr]::
9895::$$$message_0074_0012_0001$$$::If Illya cries from now on, Leys may shoot down the Emiya house as a hitman.::
9896::$$$message_0074_0013_0000$$$::"It's okay, despite how Leys looks, she has more restraint than Sella. [cacheimage storage=イリヤ11a(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=イリヤ11a(中)]Yeah, she wouldn't just split you in half."[lr]::
9897::$$$message_0074_0013_0001$$$::She adds warmly that they would catch me and interrogate me first.[lr]::
9898::$$$message_0074_0013_0002$$$::Apparently Illya's "it's okay" means, "that's good you understand; I'll think of a good excuse right now."::
9899::$$$message_0074_0014_0000$$$::"...Mistress. I believe that me having less restraint than Leysritt is some kind of misunderstanding. There is no way that I, the one who is responsible for your education, is less intelligent than Leysritt."[lr]::
9900::$$$message_0074_0014_0001$$$::"Yes. Sella more smart."::
9901::$$$message_0074_0015_0000$$$::"See. Leys is more charming than you. The difference in memory capacity doesn't equal the difference in intelligence. You should learn how to be a bit more charming, Sella."[lr]::
9902::$$$message_0074_0015_0001$$$::"With all due respect, we do not need any humaneness. All we have to do is protect you, my lady."::
9903::$$$message_0074_0016_0000$$$::"Yeah. You really are stubborn.[lr]::
9904::$$$message_0074_0016_0001$$$::Whatever. Your business is finished since you two found me, right? I'll come back early tonight just for you guys, so go home first."[lr]::
9905::$$$message_0074_0016_0002$$$::"Understood. Then we will excuse ourselves."[lr]::
9906::$$$message_0074_0016_0003$$$::"..."[lr]::
9907::$$$message_0074_0016_0004$$$::Sella is strict, but complies with Illya's command.[lr]::
9908::$$$message_0074_0016_0005$$$::On the other hand, Leys looks visibly sad.::
9909::$$$message_0074_0017_0000$$$::"Hold on. Let me ask you something, how will you two get back to the castle?"[lr]::
9910::$$$message_0074_0017_0001$$$::"We have a car at the parking lot of the shopping district. It is to give the Mistress rides, but I am allowed to use it too."[lr]::
9911::$$$message_0074_0017_0002$$$::"Use, you mean, drive?"[lr]::
9912::$$$message_0074_0017_0003$$$::"Of course. If you are going to doubt me, then shall I show you my driver's license?"::
9913::$$$message_0074_0018_0000$$$::"Oh... No, I'm not doubting you, I'm just surprised. I see, yeah, that castle is far; of course you'd have a car.[lr]::
9914::$$$message_0074_0018_0001$$$::...So, when Illya comes to our place too...?"[lr]::
9915::$$$message_0074_0018_0002$$$::"Wait, you didn't know? I drive when I come by myself."::
9916::$$$message_0074_0019_0000$$$::"Huh!?"[lr]::
9917::$$$message_0074_0019_0001$$$::T-The shocking fact that is being revealed right now...![lr]::
9918::$$$message_0074_0019_0002$$$::Her private forest aside, who knew that there would be a mysterious silver-haired girl racing down the public roads?[lr]::
9919::$$$message_0074_0019_0003$$$::...Maybe we just don't know it, but there could be a famous scary story of a street racer in the Fuyuki vicinity.::
9920::$$$message_0074_0020_0000$$$::"So, what kind of car do you ride? BerserCAR?"[lr]::
9921::$$$message_0074_0020_0001$$$::"That's a super car in another world.[lr]::
9922::$$$message_0074_0020_0002$$$::...Not that, but what was it called again? Every time Sella hears the engine she's entranced by it, saying something about it sounding like a valkyrie's cry."[lr]::
9923::$$$message_0074_0020_0003$$$::"Mistress Illyasviel. That is a Mercedes-Benz 300 SL coupe. It is an excellent machine that played a big role in the Holy Grail War ten years ago for the Einzberns." ::
9924::$$$message_0074_0021_0000$$$::"Oh yeah, it was something like that. It's all important looking even though it's merely a machine that runs. Supposedly it can go as fast as 270 kilometers per hour, but you can't even go that fast on the public roads of Japan.[lr]::
9925::$$$message_0074_0021_0001$$$::It makes me sick. It's like they like custom-made things and are unrealistic dreamers. The craftsmen of that country hate the word mass production."::
9926::$$$message_0074_0022_0000$$$::Oof, Mercedes-Benz, huh?[lr]::
9927::$$$message_0074_0022_0001$$$::I don't know what kind of famous car with a history it is, but I'm sure it's an eye-popping price.::
9928::$$$message_0074_0023_0000$$$::"Hmm. So we're going the same way until we go down the hill. Then, let's walk there together."[lr]::
9929::$$$message_0074_0023_0001$$$::"What are you saying? Though it is against my will, the Mistress is saying she does not mind going home with you. What do you take this fortune that appears once in a hundred years for?"::
9930::$$$message_0074_0024_0000$$$::"Yeah, Shirou. I'm going to leave school with you, so I need the other two to go back first. It's the same as inside the castle if Sella and Leys are around."[lr]::
9931::$$$message_0074_0024_0001$$$::"No, it's not the same as the castle. We can always leave school together but it's rare to be able to leave school with everyone."::
9932::$$$message_0074_0025_0000$$$::"Right? Let's leave like this for today.[lr]::
9933::$$$message_0074_0025_0001$$$::This hill is so long that I get sick of it every time I go to school, but it's useful at times like this."[lr]::
9934::$$$message_0074_0025_0002$$$::"...Fine, it can't be helped. If that's what you want to do, then I guess I'll do what you want just this time.[lr]::
9935::$$$message_0074_0025_0003$$$::Let's go, Sella and Leys. I shall specially allow you to accompany us until we go down the hill."::
9936::$$$message_0074_0026_0000$$$::"I-I am deeply sorry! I shall greatly appreciate your consideration...![lr]::
9937::$$$message_0074_0026_0001$$$::And Master Emiya, never forget your rudeness from this time."[lr]::
9938::$$$message_0074_0026_0002$$$::"I'm happy. Shirou good person."::
9939::$$$message_0074_0027_0000$$$::"For real, you're such a dummy, Shirou. These two are my servants, so there's no need to be considerate to them."[lr]::
9940::$$$message_0074_0027_0001$$$::Illya heads towards the hill, with the opposite expression of a foul mouth.[lr]::
9941::$$$message_0074_0027_0002$$$::The two maids follow behind her.[lr]::
9942::$$$message_0074_0027_0003$$$::This has become an odd turn of events, but this is good for a change once in a while[line len=3]::
9943::$$$message_0074_0028_0000$$$::"So. Why were you guys chasing after me?"[lr]::
9944::$$$message_0074_0028_0001$$$::"We wanted to know the reason our lady was going to school. It will be reference for the future if we find out what is attracting the attention of the Mistress."::
9945::$$$message_0074_0029_0000$$$::"Hmm. So, what does that have to do with me?"[lr]::
9946::$$$message_0074_0029_0001$$$::"Do you not have any recollection of it? It is clear that you are a part of the primary factor. If we shed light on your school life, then we can find a way to convince our young lady."::
9947::$$$message_0074_0030_0000$$$::"Hm. So does that mean you were trying to scope out my fails to hand over to Illya?"[lr]::
9948::$$$message_0074_0030_0001$$$::"You understand quickly. Unfortunately, I could not get the visual that I was hoping for."[lr]::
9949::$$$message_0074_0030_0002$$$::Sheesh.[lr]::
9950::$$$message_0074_0030_0003$$$::She's seriously looking at me like an enemy.::
9951::$$$message_0074_0031_0000$$$::"I see. Sella, how was Shirou in the morning?"[lr]::
9952::$$$message_0074_0031_0001$$$::"It was completely different from expectations. Master Emiya's actions were nothing but boring."[lr]::
9953::$$$message_0074_0031_0002$$$::"Lunch is kinda simple."::
9954::$$$message_0074_0032_0000$$$::"Oh, you two ate Shirou's lunch! I was trying to eat it!"[lr]::
9955::$$$message_0074_0032_0001$$$::"Hnng! I-I am deeply sorry Mistress, we have gone out of line...![cacheimage storage=セラ01e(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=セラ01e(中)] However, I can recreate that much with further research...!"[lr]::
9956::$$$message_0074_0032_0002$$$::"Impossible for Sella. She can't improvise.[lr]::
9957::$$$message_0074_0032_0003$$$::Also, she'll get fat from nibbling on food. Can't bear to see fat Sella."::
9958::$$$message_0074_0033_0000$$$::"L-[wvl][shock vmax=10 time=300 count=-3]Leysritt...![cacheimage storage=セラ02e(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 pos=l time=200 storage=セラ02e(中)] That is called tasting; d-do you think that I would do such an ill-mannered thing!?"[lr]::
9959::$$$message_0074_0033_0001$$$::"I don't know. Think you should hold back on midnight snacks."[lr]::
9960::$$$message_0074_0033_0002$$$::"Hnng!?[lr]::
9961::$$$message_0074_0033_0003$$$::W-why do you know that!?"::
9962::$$$message_0074_0034_0000$$$::Sella and Leys engage in a lively quarrel, and Illya laughs while going down the hill.[lr]::
9963::$$$message_0074_0034_0001$$$::I'm completely an extra.[lr]::
9964::$$$message_0074_0034_0002$$$::It's deviated from what Illya wanted to do, but I think this was good this time.[lr]::
9965::$$$message_0074_0034_0003$$$::A few more minutes until the intersection.[lr]::
9966::$$$message_0074_0034_0004$$$::The clamor of the evening seems like it will continue for a little longer.::
909887::$$$message_9074_0010_0001$$$::"But, that sounds kind of fun."[r]::

